						<h2>Multiplication: 17 x 23</h2>
			<p>The multiplication of seventeen times twenty-three is equal to three hundred ninety-one. We can also express that 17 times 23 equals 391 as follows:</p>
			<p class="big-text">17 &#215; 23 = 391</p>
			<p class="big-text">17 * 23 = 391</p>
			<p class="big-text">17 by 23 = 391</p>
